@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### GET список
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### POST створити
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "A-100",
  "name": "Цемент M400",
  "unit": "мішок",
  "quantity": 40
}

### GET за id (замініть id на отриманий з POST)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/8f1c0e2a
Accept: application/json

### PUT замінити
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/8f1c0e2a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "A-100",
  "name": "Цемент M500",
  "unit": "мішок",
  "quantity": 35
}

### PUT з порожньою назвою -> 400
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/8f1c0e2a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "A-100",
  "name": "",
  "unit": "мішок",
  "quantity": 35
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/8f1c0e2a

### GET після DELETE -> 404
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/8f1c0e2a
Accept: application/json